  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal, often medical term. In everyday conversation, ⟦{治|なお}る→治る：19598_naoru⟧ (to heal, to get better) is more common. {治癒|ちゆ} is used in medical reports, health articles, and formal writing.\n\nThe compound {自然治癒力|しぜんちゆりょく} (natural healing power) is widely used in health contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {治癒|ちゆ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to heal, to be cured\n- ⟦{完全|かんぜん}→完全：01552_kanzen⟧{治癒|ちゆ}: complete recovery\n- ⟦{自然|しぜん}→自然：01423_shizen⟧{治癒|ちゆ}: natural healing\n- ⟦{自然|しぜん}→自然：01423_shizen⟧{治癒力|ちゆりょく}: natural healing ability\n- {治癒|ちゆ}⟦{率|りつ}→率：03802_ritsu⟧: cure rate",
